Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:20.22,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}満たされないままだった
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.90,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}独りよがりの emotion
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:26.45,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}はぐらかすように bringin' on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:27.83,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}風を切って
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:30.65,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}失うものなんてない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:33.28,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}守るべきものもない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:37.82,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}遠吠えはいつか青い空に fly away
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.58,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}Just tell me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:42.66,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}答えを探しながら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:45.86,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}たとえ無謀だと言われても
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.73,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}構わない
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:50.37,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}今扉を開けるんだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:53.26,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}起死回生望んだ future
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:58.14,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}手を伸ばして手繰り寄せる
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:00.04,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}This is my revolution
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:03.69,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}ただつき進んでくだけ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:09.51,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}運命さえ片っ端から get out of the way
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:10.83,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}I gotta do it alright
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.12,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}根拠も何もない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.75,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}行く手を阻む奴は皆 no more chance
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:15.90,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}似ても似つかない
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.36,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}ヒーローに成り上がれ
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:20.07,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}笑え 共に prove my soul yeah
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:22.90,op jp,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}誰かを守る強さを
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:25.57,op jp,,0,0,0,,この心臓に宿して
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:30.67,op jp,,0,0,0,,綱渡りのように climb to the top
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.43,0:02:20.22,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一直都沒有得到滿足
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}總是自以為是的感情
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:26.45,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一直躁動彷彿要破碎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.45,0:02:27.83,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}風馳電掣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.95,0:02:30.65,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}感覺已經沒有什麼可以失去的了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.70,0:02:33.28,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}也沒有什麼應該守護的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.41,0:02:37.82,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}吶喊總有一天要在這晴空之下 高飛遠方
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.82,0:02:39.58,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}只告訴我你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.58,0:02:42.66,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}一起去尋找那個答案
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.85,0:02:45.86,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}即便被說成魯莽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.86,0:02:47.73,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}也沒關係
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.73,0:02:50.37,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}現在打開內心封鎖的門扉吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.37,0:02:53.26,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}希望那消失的未來能夠重新明亮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.42,0:02:58.14,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}伸出手讓我們走在一起
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.24,0:03:00.04,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}這就是我的革命
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.04,0:03:03.69,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}只需要與我一起同行
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.82,0:03:09.51,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}就算命運也要在這一端開始讓路
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:10.83,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}我必須去做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.83,0:03:12.12,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}沒有任何的依據
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.12,0:03:14.75,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}阻擋去路的人都不可能得逞到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.75,0:03:15.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}似乎但也不如
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:17.36,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}成為那個頂點吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.36,0:03:20.07,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}共同歡笑 證明我的內心是對的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.34,0:03:22.90,op zh,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\c&HFFFFFF&\1a&H00&}想要守護某人的堅強
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.03,0:03:25.57,op zh,,0,0,0,,就寄宿在這顆心臟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:30.67,op zh,,0,0,0,,就彷彿是在走鋼絲一般 達到那個山頂
